capability chunk/semantic  a text cut where the meaning of its sentences changes
  heroes  refused: the change is measured between a model's embeddings of each sentence, which a program asks a model for (`llm/openai`); the sentences are `boundaries`', and the cut between them is the program's once it has the embeddings
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  llama_index.core.node_parser.SemanticSplitterNodeParser, llama_index.core.node_parser.SemanticDoubleMergingSplitterNodeParser
  note    -

